EXTERNAL DEPENDENCIES AND BUNDLED CONTENT

Icons — `icons/soap.svg`, `icons/pizza.svg`, and `icons/burger.svg` are
Font Awesome Free 6.7.2 icons by Fonticons, Inc. (https://fontawesome.com).
They are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0): https://fontawesome.com/license/free

`icons/scoop.svg`, `icons/coin-gold.svg`, `icons/coin-silver.svg`, and `icons/coin-copper.svg` are original and covered by the MIT License above.

Pixel art and sound effects — the creature parts under `Looks/`, grave and
mess sprites, and the WAV files under `sounds/` are original work and are
covered by the MIT License above.

Runtime — this plugin requires Omarchy 4 (Quattro) or newer. It uses only
the Omarchy shell / Quickshell APIs already present on the system. It
installs nothing, downloads nothing, requires no elevated privileges, and
makes no network connections of its own. It reads local MPRIS players so
the pet can watch YouTube or dance to music.
